---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="POCSO Act Matters | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="General information on the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">POCSO Act Matters</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>The Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act provides special procedures for offences against children. This article is for general information only.</p>
      <p>The Act contains strict provisions regarding evidence, recording of statements, and trial. Bail considerations are also specific.</p>
      <p>Professional legal advice is essential in such matters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-navy/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy mb-4">Related</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/practice" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Practice Areas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact the Firm</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
